{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","狂轰滥炸"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","库露露的所有技能均会造成无视敌我的伤害。主动使用时对敌方半场进行持续的地毯式轰炸。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，库露露的普通攻击会产生爆炸，对目标周围1格范围内的角色造成80% ATK伤害。库露露的所有技能均会造成无视敌我的伤害，但友军受到来自自身的伤害降低70%。\n主动使用时，向敌方半场倾泻怒火，总共召唤14次地毯式轰炸，每次轰炸会随机选择敌方半场内的一个格子，并对半径1格范围内的所有角色造成90% + 10% ATK伤害。最后，召唤巨大化的使魔弹·阿爆，对敌方半场内的所有角色造成250% + 25% ATK伤害。该技能仅在敌方半场有敌人时可以释放，且释放期间自身获得霸体。\n每次释放该技能，至少有10次轰炸会选择能够覆盖至少1名敌人的格子，且至少有6次轰炸会选择敌方最密集区域。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":150,"end":156,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":196,"end":202,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":147,"end":160,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":192,"end":206,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":236,"end":238,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每一次地毯式轰炸造成的伤害提升至100% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每一次地毯式轰炸造成的伤害提升至110% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每一次地毯式轰炸造成的伤害提升至120% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","每一次地毯式轰炸造成的伤害提升至130% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","爆破封锁"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时将敌方半场边缘炸成阻碍通行的废墟。主动使用时对一名敌人造成伤害并将其击飞。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，库露露将敌方半场边缘炸毁，形成阻碍通行的废墟，将位于这些格子的角色向其所在阵营方向击退。其中，正中央格子上的废墟可在受到6 + 1次攻击后被摧毁、其余格子上的废墟则永久不可破坏。\n每当正中央的废墟被破坏，库露露会自动呼叫延迟爆破，在8秒后再次炸毁该格子并形成废墟。\n主动使用时，库露露闪现至离自身最近的敌人面前，对其造成150% + 20% ATK伤害并将其击飞，随后返回原位。若目标位于己方半场，则改为将其向敌方半场方向击退至多3格。库露露在本技能释放期间无敌。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":67,"end":71,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":170,"end":176,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":166,"end":180,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":235,"end":237,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时造成的伤害提升至170% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时造成的伤害提升至190% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时造成的伤害提升至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","阿爆来袭！"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤阿爆将最靠前的两名敌人吞噬并带到敌方半场，并在过程中产生数次爆炸。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","释放使魔弹·阿爆，阿爆会进行3次弹跳，前两跳会分别选择最靠前的2名敌人并将其吞噬、最后一跳会选择敌方半场最靠后的1名敌人并将吞噬目标吐出。阿爆每次弹跳会对落点半径1格范围内的所有角色造成110% + 10% ATK伤害，并使其移动速度降低60%，持续3秒。被吞噬的目标无法攻击和行动，且不会受到来自阿爆以外的伤害。如果最后一跳没有符合条件的目标，则改为向敌方半场方向跳至多3格。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":97,"end":103,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontest"},{"start":52,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"keyword:backest"},{"start":93,"end":107,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","阿爆每次弹跳造成的伤害提升至120% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","阿爆每次弹跳造成的伤害提升至130% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","阿爆每次弹跳造成的伤害提升至140% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力，对敌人造成伤害后额外提高攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中提升6%攻击力。每次对敌人造成伤害，额外提高0.6%攻击力，最多叠加50层。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中提升8%攻击力。每次对敌人造成伤害，额外提高0.8%攻击力，最多叠加50层。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中提升10%攻击力。每次对敌人造成伤害，额外提高1%攻击力，最多叠加50层。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","易爆小心！"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时为场上所有敌人施加“易爆”状态，在其被击败后将其转化为一颗会爆炸的殉爆弹。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，使场上所有敌人获得“易爆”状态，受到伤害提高10%，持续至战斗结束。当一名受“易爆”影响的角色被击败后，库露露会将其转化为一枚殉爆弹，并在2秒后爆炸，对半径2格内的所有单位造成210% ATK伤害，并附带殉爆弹初始生命值15%的额外伤害，最高不超过自身攻击力的300%。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":94,"end":102,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","殉爆弹爆炸造成的基础伤害提升至240% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","殉爆弹爆炸造成的基础伤害提升至270% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每当一枚殉爆弹被引爆，库露露获得持续10秒的“爆破狂欢”状态，在此期间自身获得35点穿透，并且普通攻击、技能“狂轰滥炸”、“阿爆来袭！”的爆炸范围扩大至2格。该效果多次触发时不会叠加增益效果，但会使“爆破狂欢”状态延长对应的持续时间。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","所在半场内没有敌人时，提升攻击速度和远程防御。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","所在半场内没有敌人时，库露露获得40点攻击速度与40点远程防御；所在半场内每有一名敌人，对应的属性加成便会降低10点，最多降低至20点。同一半场内的其他友军获得该效果50%的增益。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","使魔弹·阿爆"]]}